hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1539","On the authority of Abu Ammar Al-Hussein bin Harith, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talha, on the authority of Anas bin Malik, he said: “I prayed An orphan and I followed the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, and my mother prayed behind us.”"
"1540","We are Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala, we are Sufyan, Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talha told us, he heard Anas bin Malik say the same thing."
